 Sail the seas and discover hidden lands. Partake in quests and pursue a captivating campaign with plenty of side content as you unravel the secrets of the uncharted and deadly Fadelands.  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027760/extras/fa5e8d545ab1daf372bc2b3e7a3ffe87.poster.avif?t=1771456154\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027760/extras/fa5e8d545ab1daf372bc2b3e7a3ffe87.webm?t=1771456154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Ever Changing World.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the weather and shifting environmental factors as you plan your travels to your advantage. Passages and secrets will open up and close off. Treasure will be influenced. Certain abilities and enemies may grow stronger. You may find something new in a place you thought you already explored. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027760/extras/43ffdba97be6af11d0f583e632fbe015.poster.avif?t=1771456154\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027760/extras/43ffdba97be6af11d0f583e632fbe015.webm?t=1771456154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Trek will be Dangerous.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foes that you encounter on your journey will test your strength. Unleash your creativity by making custom spells. Combine abilities with potent reactions. Strategically chain attacks with your party members to create deadly effects. Do whatever it takes to achieve victory in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin